ossorigin=\"\" href=\"/assets/accordion-dyUKY8Mt.js\"><link rel=\"modulepreload\" as=\"script\" crossorigin=\"\" href=\"/assets/faq-monochrome-jJtIbDxR.js\"><link rel=\"modulepreload\" as=\"script\" crossorigin=\"\" href=\"/assets/lightbulb-Cf7ZGOoN.js\"><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I receive my product after purchase?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Once your payment is confirmed, the product is delivered straight to your PXN account. Open Purchase History and your credentials, keys or configs appear there — you'll also get an email notification. No need to message support.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does delivery take?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Most orders are delivered within minutes of payment confirmation. During off-hours or for manually provisioned products it can take a little longer, but we aim for under 30 minutes.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What products do you sell?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"CapCut Pro, ChatGPT Plus, YouTube Premium, Netflix Premium, Canva Pro, Freepik Premium, Discord Nitro, V2Ray VPN, Cloud VPS and game top-ups such as PUBG UC and Free Fire Diamonds.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What payment methods do you accept?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Bank transfer (Sampath, Commercial Bank, HNB, BOC), eZ Cash, Koko and Binance. After placing an order you'll get the payment details to complete the transfer, then upload your proof.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I get a refund?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Because products are digital, refunds are generally not possible after delivery. If something isn't working, contact us — we'll replace it or fix it under warranty.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"My payment is confirmed but nothing arrived — what now?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Check Purchase History first. If the order is still pending after 30 minutes, open the support chat with your order number and we'll push it through.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are the accounts private or shared?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Most accounts are private, so only you have access. A few products (like Netflix) use a private profile with your own PIN on a shared account.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long are subscriptions valid?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It depends on the product: most software accounts run 1 month, Canva Pro runs 1 year, and V2Ray VPN plans range from 1 month to 1 year. Validity starts at activation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you offer warranties?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Most products include warranty for the active subscription period — for example ChatGPT Plus includes a 1-for-1 replacement within the first month.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where do I find my V2Ray config?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Open Purchase History and expand your V2Ray order — you can copy the config, reveal it in full, and copy your usage link to track data in real time.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I switch routing to Warp+ or an LK IP?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Use the routing switcher on your V2Ray card. Disconnect the VPN before switching — then reconnect.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What happens when I hit my data limit?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Your connection is throttled until the quota resets at midnight, or you can renew/upgrade your plan at any time from the V2Ray page.\"}}]}</script></head>\n\n  <body>\n    <div id=\"root\"><div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Notifications (F8)\" tab